OL,3,GNEWSACorby must 'show authentic voice'
OL,4,Ain culture bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FCorby will need to showcase its
OL,7,F"authentic voice" and the aspirations
OL,8,Fof locals in its bid to be crowned Town
OL,9,Fof Culture 2028, the head judge of the
OL,10,Fcompetition Sir Phil Redmond has said.
OL,12,FThe Grange Hill and Brookside creator
OL,13,Fvisited the Northamptonshire town on
OL,14,FMonday for an informal visit, where he
OL,15,Fwas shown around several locations
OL,16,Fincluding Corby Cube, Adrenaline Alley
OL,17,Fand Chapel Gym.
OL,19,F"We're looking for a place that wants
OL,20,Fto celebrate who they are," said Sir
OL,21,FPhil.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
